{"title":"6 ft Artificial Christmas Trees","description":"\u003cp\u003eIncorporating a 6 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree into your holiday decor \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eStep into the enchanting world of the Carol's Christmas Conifers 6-Foot Artificial Christmas Trees Collection, where holiday magic takes on a shape and style to suit every taste and space. Our extensive range of 6-foot artificial Christmas trees offers a delightful array of options, ensuring that you find the perfect tree to bring your festive vision to life.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur 6 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree Features \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eWhether you prefer the versatility of an unlit tree or the convenience of a pre-lit one, our collection of artificial 6 - 6.5’ Christmas Trees has you covered. Unlit trees provide a blank canvas for your creativity, while our pre-lit options come adorned with a brilliant array of lights, creating a captivating and hassle-free holiday display. Choose from classic needle tips for a traditional look, realistic needle tips that mirror the appearance of real fir or evergreen trees, or the perfect blend of both for a tree that truly stands out.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e6 Foot Artificial Christmas Tree Sizes \u0026amp; Styles \u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eWe understand that not all spaces are created equal, so our 6 Foot Artificial Christmas Trees come in a variety of shapes and profiles. Opt for a slim-shaped tree that gracefully fits into tighter spaces, a full-bodied tree that exudes grandeur, or a space-saving pencil-shaped tree that adds a touch of elegance to compact areas. But that's not all - our collection offers an array of enchanting colors to match your unique holiday theme. From the classic and rich green to the cool, refreshing green, and even the whimsical charm of pink and blue flocked options, you'll find the perfect hue to harmonize with your holiday decor.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan style=\"font-weight: 400;\"\u003eExperience the joy of the season with a Carol's Christmas Conifers Artificial Christmas Tree. No matter your style, space, or color preference, our diverse range of options ensures that your holiday decor will shine bright and beautiful. Explore our collection today and discover the perfect tree to make your holiday dreams come true.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"6-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"6' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 350 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642895921216,"sku":"PF-T6-L","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_fbb2edf4-c5c9-4ad1-b201-ca0c1c1c4b0e.jpg?v=1714675465"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642896805952,"sku":"QF-T6.5-U","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-5_67d3c5cc-8f63-4646-82b6-ac5667cde3ad.jpg?v=1718158334"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897068096,"sku":"QF-T6.5-L","price":499.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_7831fc2c-0c60-49cb-9368-a7127a8aaa1c.jpg?v=1722012623"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642901393472,"sku":"KFS-T6.5-U","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-4_e7d10a3a-8506-4193-a238-f2c4735477fb.jpg?v=1718158125"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003