atherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642923741248,"sku":"RF-T6.5-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/RoyalFir_20f68d8d-c632-40c6-9197-a0d56de53b1b.png?v=1722013184"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642924822592,"sku":"RFS-T6.5-U","price":399.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-6.jpg?v=1718158268"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-royal-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Royal Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eElevate your holiday season with the authentically crafted Royal Fir, inspired by the grandeur of the stately Grand Fir and its iconic, lush greenery. Each branch is designed to showcase rich foliage, creating a warm, inviting centerpiece perfect for treasured traditions, cozy gatherings, and unforgettable holiday memories.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642924953664,"sku":"RFS-T6.5-L","price":699.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Royal-Fir-Slim-v2_e8fb1dec-d959-441f-aec8-9a923eb82099.jpg?v=1722013081"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-cypress-spruce-tree-led","title":"6.5' Cypress Spruce Artificial Christmas Tree with 1000 Warm White \u0026 Multi-Color LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eInspired by the majestic White Spruce, the Cypress Spruce showcases lush, true-to-nature greenery and vibrant, rich color. Carefully designed for realism and ease, it brings the serene charm of a winter forest into your home for a truly festive season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ LED","offer_id":28642925936704,"sku":"CS-T6.5-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/CypressSpruce_f0f71604-0519-417b-98ce-d9abe379435a.png?v=1714667202"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Fraser Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 600 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":29211290763328,"sku":"KFFS-T6.5-L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFraserFirSlim.jpg?v=1786731058"},{"product_id":"6-5-pink-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Duchess Pink Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Pink","offer_id":30106209878080,"sku":"PINKF-T6-5L","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Pink.Duchess.jpg?v=1718157841"},{"product_id":"6-5-blue-flock-tree-led","title":"6.5' Duchess Blue Flock Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring a magical winter wonderland into your home with the one and only, Duchess Flock. This artfully designed masterpiece features vibrant colors and intricate details, creating a unique, unforgettable centerpiece that delights and inspires holiday memories for years to come.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Blue","offer_id":30106210041920,"sku":"BLUEF-T6-5L","price":359.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/BlueDuchess_bf0a3bb7-e06d-4c25-9ab5-6f5eeed9128e.jpg?v=1714666421"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":32364637618253,"sku":"QFS-T6.5-U","price":249.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/FlockedGroup-2_561525bc-2862-4ea3-818a-54d2e7d8e62d.jpg?v=1718158410"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-queen-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Queen Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree With 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":32364637716557,"sku":"QFS-T6.5-L","price":449.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlockSlim_c84ff106-7f3e-4126-b467-263d8999e7b5.jpg?v=1722012683"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Yorkshire Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 500 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":37150212980936,"sku":"YF-T6.5-L","price":349.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Yorkshire-Fir-v1.png?v=1722014823"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-king-fraser-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' King Fraser Fir Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the holiday season with the natural splendor of the Appalachian Mountains brought right into your home with the King Fraser Fir. Designed to mirror the majestic Fraser Fir, its lush foliage and classic conical shape really captures the authenticity of a real tree. Find the perfect size for your space and enjoy a holiday season full of lifelike charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":37762446000328,"sku":"KFF-T6.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/King-Fraser-Fir-Full-v2_6b2544d9-4d5d-476d-8b35-dda8f975daf0.jpg?v=1718158370"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-yorkshire-fir-slim-tree-led","title":"6.5' Yorkshire Fir Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 400 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into a charming winter oasis with the beautifully sculpted Yorkshire Fir. Skillfully created to reflect the natural beauty of the Silver Fir, its full foliage and rich color bring the warmth and charm of a real tree right into your home. Perfect for creating a timeless centerpiece, it invites joy and celebration throughout the season.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":37778112446664,"sku":"YFS-T6.5-L","price":299.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/YorkshireFirSlim.png?v=1722014899"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-scarlet-fir-tree-unlit","title":"6.5' Scarlet Fir Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eCelebrate the wonder of the season with the artfully crafted Scarlet Fir, thoughtfully designed to emulate the breathtaking beauty of the majestic Black Hills Spruce. Its realistic branches, true-to-life color, and delicate tips create an elegant, festive centerpiece that captures the charm of a real tree, without the upkeep. Make every holiday moment unforgettable with this stunning tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5' \/ Unlit","offer_id":40284905406664,"sku":"SF-T6.5-U","price":289.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/scarlet-fir-artificial-christmas-tree.jpg?v=1722013540"},{"product_id":"6-5-foot-silverpeak-fir-tree-led","title":"6.5' Silverpeak Fir™ Artificial Christmas Tree 2500 Lux LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eStep into a world of holiday magic with the newest Silverpeak Fir, our most exquisitely crafted tree that transforms your home into a whimsical winter wonderland. Inspired by the majestic American White Fir, with every branch and needle meticulously designed to look impossibly real, you’d never believe it didn't come straight from the Rocky Mountains. Its full-bodied foliage, brilliant elegance, and layered shape create a breathtaking centerpiece that radiates warmth, joy, and festive charm.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","offers":[{"title":"6.5'","offer_id":44792072896712,"sku":"SLP-T6.5-L","price":899.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/Silverpeakfir.png?v=1761067054"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/Queen_Flock_db013460-08fe-4dff-9578-341dd6ba1419.jpg?v=1666795569","url":"/\/collections\/6-foot-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"Carol's Christmas Conifers","version":"1.0","type":"link"}